        "Id1": {
            "text": "English Without Tears is a 89 minute film that was written and produced by Anatole de Grunwald. the movie was released on July 28th, 1944. Nicholas Brodszky was the musical composer and Harold French was the director . The editing was done by Alan Jaggs."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "The film English Without Tears, which was released on July 28, 1944, has a running time of 89 minutes. The film was composed by Nicholas Brodszky, directed by Harold French, edited by Alan Jaggs, and was written and produced by Anatole de Grunwald."
        },
